      "id": "claim_5f7b589c9aba416c9b4fff4d63e3c8de",
      "statement": "scripts/zf_openwiki_gate.py deterministically decides whether OpenWiki docs need a sync: it skips when openwiki/ is missing, the working tree is dirty, or (unless forced) an openwiki-titled task is already active in triage/todo/ready/running/blocked (has_active_openwiki_task); when HEAD has advanced past the last openwiki-touching commit it creates at most one P2 todo task for zf-builder via create_openwiki_task — through the dashboard create-task endpoint with a SQLite fallback — and never wakes an LLM.",
