      "statement": "The tasks router supports PATCH /tasks/{task_id} to update task fields in one call (mirroring the new `hermes zerofactory update` CLI command), and guards query parameters (board, status, assignee, priority, search) with isinstance string checks so non-string task fields never break grill/conflict status handling.",
